msgctxt "Parker"
msgid "I'm on the seventh space - Looking for a Sunny Spot! Sure is crowded today..."
msgstr "Je suis sur la septième case : À la Recherche d'un Coin Ensoleillé ! Il y a un monde fou aujourd'hui..."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: parker_boardgames/parker_board_outcome/10/b/1
msgctxt "Parker"
msgid "I'm on the eighth space - The Perfect Spot! Now to set up my blanket..."
msgstr "Je suis sur la huitième case : L'Endroit Parfait ! Il ne reste plus qu'à installer ma serviette..."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: parker_boardgames/parker_board_outcome/11/b/1
msgctxt "Parker"
msgid "I'm on the ninth space - Loud Music Family! I'm set up next to a family blasting tunes - looks like I'll have to go back two spaces to find another spot!"
msgstr "Je suis sur la neuvième case : La Famille au Son Trop Fort ! Je me suis installé à côté d'une famille qui hurle sa musique : je dois reculer de deux cases pour trouver une autre place !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: parker_boardgames/parker_board_outcome/12/b/1
msgctxt "Parker"
msgid "I'm on the tenth space - Big Bad Sun! Ah, I didn't bring sunscreen out of the car, so I'll have to go back all the way to space 4... oh dear!"
msgstr "Je suis sur la dixième case : Le Grand Méchant Soleil ! Ah, je n'ai pas sorti la crème solaire de la voiture, donc retour à la case 4... Oh là là !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: parker_boardgames/parker_board_outcome/13/b/1
msgctxt "Parker"
msgid "I'm on the tenth space - Big Bad Sun! Good thing I brought the sunscreen out of the car! I move forward one space!"
msgstr "Je suis sur la dixième case : Le Grand Méchant Soleil ! Heureusement que j'ai sorti la crème solaire de la voiture ! J'avance d'une case !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: parker_boardgames/parker_board_outcome/14/b/1
msgctxt "Parker"
msgid "I'm on the eleventh space - Notifications Off! I'm almost to a perfect Sandy Holiday!"
msgstr "Je suis sur la onzième case : Notifications Coupées ! Je suis presque à des Vacances de Sable parfaites !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: parker_boardgames/parker_board_outcome/15/b/1
msgctxt "Parker"
msgid "I made it to the Sandy Kingdom! I win!"
msgstr "J'ai atteint le Royaume de Sable ! Je gagne !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: parker_boardgames/parker_board_outcome/18 parker_boardgames/parker_board_outcome_swimsuit/26
msgctxt "Parker"
msgid "Looks like it's back to you..."
msgstr "On dirait que c'est de nouveau à toi..."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: parker_boardgames/player_wins_beach/0/0
msgctxt "Parker"
msgid "I tried my best, but you were simply a better beach-goer!"
msgstr "J'ai fait de mon mieux, mais tu étais tout simplement meilleur{{|e|·e}} que moi comme vacancier{{|ère|·ère}} !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: parker_boardgames/player_wins_beach/0/8/s/0 parker_boardgames/player_wins_beach_swimsuit/0/22/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "In your face, bitch!"
msgstr "Dans ta face, pauvre naze !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: parker_boardgames/player_wins_beach/0/9/s/0 parker_boardgames/player_wins_beach_swimsuit/0/23/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm so happy!"
msgstr "Je suis trop content{{|e|·e}} !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: parker_boardgames/player_wins_beach/0/10/s/0 parker_boardgames/player_wins_beach_swimsuit/0/24/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "That just seemed like luck..."
msgstr "Ça m'a juste semblé être de la chance..."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: parker_boardgames/player_wins_beach/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Parker"
msgid "It doesn't matter if you're mean to me or gloat - I'll still love you if you roll a love ending with me!"
msgstr "Peu importe que tu sois méchant avec moi ou que tu te vantes : je t'aimerai quand même si tu obtiens une fin Amour avec moi !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: parker_boardgames/player_wins_beach/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Parker"
msgid "I'm proud of you. And you get to enjoy the beach!"
msgstr "Je suis fier de toi. Et tu vas pouvoir profiter de la plage !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: parker_boardgames/player_wins_beach/0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Parker"
msgid "It was! Games can be all about luck!"
msgstr "Elle l'était ! Les jeux peuvent être une pure affaire de chance !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: parker_boardgames/player_wins_beach/0/g-0/0 parker_boardgames/player_wins_beach_swimsuit/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Parker"
msgid "That's one victory for you - I'll add it to your dice roll to see what our relationship will be. I'm so excited for you!"
msgstr "Ça fait une victoire pour toi : je l'ajouterai à ton lancer de dé pour savoir ce que sera notre relation. Je suis tellement excité pour toi !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: parker_boardgames/player_wins_beach/0/g-0/11 parker_boardgames/parker_wins_beach/0/g-0/19 parker_boardgames/parker_wins_beach_swimsuit/0/g-0/19
msgctxt "Parker"
msgid "Come see me next time... for the ancient game of Chess!"
msgstr "Viens me voir la prochaine fois... pour l'antique jeu d'Échecs !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: parker_boardgames/player_wins_beach/0/g-0/19/s/0 parker_boardgames/parker_wins_beach/0/g-0/27/s/0 parker_boardgames/player_wins_beach_swimsuit/0/g-0/19/s/0 parker_boardgames/parker_wins_beach_swimsuit/0/g-0/27/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "See you around, Parker."
msgstr "À plus tard, Parker."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: parker_boardgames/player_wins_beach/0/g-0/20/s/0 parker_boardgames/parker_wins_beach/0/g-0/28/s/0 parker_boardgames/player_wins_beach_swimsuit/0/g-0/20/s/0 parker_boardgames/parker_wins_beach_swimsuit/0/g-0/28/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Oooh, chess..."
msgstr "Oooh, les échecs..."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: parker_boardgames/player_wins_beach/0/g-0/21/s/0 parker_boardgames/parker_wins_beach/0/g-0/29/s/0 parker_boardgames/player_wins_beach_swimsuit/0/g-0/21/s/0 parker_boardgames/parker_wins_beach_swimsuit/0/g-0/29/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "All right, sure."
msgstr "D'accord, très bien."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: parker_boardgames/player_wins_beach/0/g-0/c-3/7 parker_boardgames/parker_wins_beach/0/g-0/c-3/7 parker_boardgames/player_wins_beach_swimsuit/0/g-0/c-3/7 parker_boardgames/parker_wins_beach_swimsuit/0/g-0/c-3/7
msgctxt "Parker"
msgid "Bye bye!"
msgstr "Salut salut !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: parker_boardgames/player_wins_beach/0/g-0/c-4/7 parker_boardgames/parker_wins_beach/0/g-0/c-4/7 parker_boardgames/player_wins_beach_swimsuit/0/g-0/c-4/7 parker_boardgames/parker_wins_beach_swimsuit/0/g-0/c-4/7
msgctxt "Parker"
msgid "You've heard of it? Excellent!"
msgstr "Tu en as entendu parler ? Excellent !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: parker_boardgames/player_wins_beach/0/g-0/c-4/15 parker_boardgames/player_wins_beach/0/g-0/c-5/7 parker_boardgames/parker_wins_beach/0/g-0/c-4/15 parker_boardgames/parker_wins_beach/0/g-0/c-5/7 parker_boardgames/player_wins_beach_swimsuit/0/g-0/c-4/15 parker_boardgames/player_wins_beach_swimsuit/0/g-0/c-5/7 parker_boardgames/parker_wins_beach_swimsuit/0/g-0/c-4/15 parker_boardgames/parker_wins_beach_swimsuit/0/g-0/c-5/7
msgctxt "Parker"
msgid "See you... potential lover/friend/enemy..."
msgstr "À bientôt... amant, ami ou ennemi potentiel..."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: parker_boardgames/parker_wins_beach/0/0
msgctxt "Parker"
msgid "Woohoo! I'm the best!"
msgstr "Youpi ! Je suis le meilleur !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: parker_boardgames/parker_wins_beach/0/8/s/0 parker_boardgames/parker_wins_beach_swimsuit/0/38/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "That was just luck!"
msgstr "C'était juste de la chance !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: parker_boardgames/parker_wins_beach/0/9/s/0 parker_boardgames/parker_wins_beach_swimsuit/0/39/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You won fair and square..."
msgstr "Tu as gagné à la régulière..."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: parker_boardgames/parker_wins_beach/0/10/s/0 parker_boardgames/parker_wins_beach_swimsuit/0/40/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Congratulations!"
msgstr "Félicitations !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: parker_boardgames/parker_wins_beach/0/c-0/7 parker_boardgames/parker_wins_beach_swimsuit/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Parker"
msgid "Luck is the basis for many games! Tough noogies, duder!"
msgstr "La chance est la base de bien des jeux ! Tant pis pour tes pommes !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: parker_boardgames/parker_wins_beach/0/c-1/7 parker_boardgames/parker_wins_beach_swimsuit/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Parker"
msgid "I sure did!"
msgstr "Et comment !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: parker_boardgames/parker_wins_beach/0/c-2/7 parker_boardgames/parker_wins_beach_swimsuit/0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Parker"
msgid "Thank you!"
msgstr "Merci !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: parker_boardgames/parker_wins_beach/0/g-0/0 parker_boardgames/parker_wins_beach_swimsuit/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Parker"
msgid "That's one victory for me! The relationship die stays the same then..."
msgstr "Ça fait une victoire pour moi ! Le dé de la relation reste donc inchangé..."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: parker_boardgames/parker_wins_beach/0/g-0/11 parker_boardgames/parker_wins_beach_swimsuit/0/g-0/11
msgctxt "Parker"
msgid "There's still hope for you, though!"
msgstr "Mais il y a encore de l'espoir pour toi !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: parker_boardgames/beach_game_return_swimsuit/0/0
msgctxt "Parker"
msgid "Phew! It's your turn! What will you do?"
msgstr "Ouf ! C'est ton tour ! Que vas-tu faire ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: parker_boardgames/beach_game_return_swimsuit/0/c-1/50/c-0/21
msgctxt "Parker"
msgid "Ah yeah yeah! You were about to win! I'll have to spin better!"
msgstr "Ah oui, oui ! Tu étais sur le point de gagner ! Je vais devoir mieux tourner !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: parker_boardgames/player_board_outcome_swimsuit/0/b/13
msgctxt "Parker"
msgid "The thought of you licking that ice cream... whoo baby."
msgstr "L'idée de te voir lécher cette glace... houlà, mon chou."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: parker_boardgames/player_board_outcome_swimsuit/0/b/21
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Parker swallows thickly, his eyes flicking over your swimsuited form."
msgstr "Parker déglutit péniblement, son regard glissant sur votre silhouette en maillot de bain."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: parker_boardgames/player_board_outcome_swimsuit/0/b/29 parker_boardgames/parker_board_outcome_swimsuit/18
msgctxt "Parker"
msgid "<w>gulp</w>"
msgstr "<w>glou</w>"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: parker_boardgames/player_board_outcome_swimsuit/0/b/40
msgctxt "Parker"
msgid "I think I'm uh... gonna need to skip my turn and have a think."
msgstr "Je crois que je vais euh... devoir passer mon tour et réfléchir un peu."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: parker_boardgames/player_board_outcome_swimsuit/9/b/1
msgctxt "Parker"
msgid "You're on the seventh space - Looking for a Sunny Spot! It sure is crowded today... everyone's looking..."
msgstr "Tu es sur la septième case : À la Recherche d'un Coin Ensoleillé ! Il y a un monde fou aujourd'hui... tout le monde regarde..."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: parker_boardgames/player_board_outcome_swimsuit/11/b/1
msgctxt "Parker"
msgid "You're on the ninth space - Loud Music Family! You're set up next to a family blasting tunes. Oh god, there's a whole big family there. They can see me."
msgstr "Tu es sur la neuvième case : La Famille au Son Trop Fort ! Ta serviette est à côté d'une famille qui hurle sa musique. Oh mon dieu, il y a toute une grande famille. Ils peuvent me voir."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: parker_boardgames/player_board_outcome_swimsuit/11/b/12
msgctxt "Parker"
msgid "Looks like you'll have to go back two spaces to find another spot!"
msgstr "On dirait que tu dois reculer de deux cases pour trouver une autre place !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: parker_boardgames/player_board_outcome_swimsuit/12/b/1
msgctxt "Parker"
msgid "You're on the tenth space - Big Bad Sun! Oh, you didn't bring sunscreen out of the car so you'll have to go back all the way to space 4? Oh dear, you gotta get it on your tummy."
msgstr "Tu es sur la dixième case : Le Grand Méchant Soleil ! Oh, tu n'as pas sorti la crème solaire de la voiture, donc retour à la case 4 ? Oh là là, il faut t'en mettre sur le ventre."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: parker_boardgames/player_board_outcome_swimsuit/13/b/1
msgctxt "Parker"
msgid "You're on the tenth space - Big Bad Sun! Good thing you brought the sunscreen out of the car! You move forward one space! If you can get the spot on my back..."
msgstr "Tu es sur la dixième case : Le Grand Méchant Soleil ! Heureusement que tu as sorti la crème solaire de la voiture ! Tu avances d'une case ! Si tu peux t'occuper de l'endroit dans mon dos..."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: parker_boardgames/player_board_outcome_swimsuit/15/b/1
msgctxt "Parker"
msgid "You're made it to the Sandy Kingdom! You win! Heh. Congrats!"
msgstr "Tu as atteint le Royaume de Sable ! Tu gagnes ! Hé hé. Félicitations !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: parker_boardgames/parker_beach_roller_swimsuit/7
msgctxt "Parker"
msgid "Oh boy... I'm gonna spin, huh? Even though I..."
msgstr "Oh là là... je vais devoir tourner, hein ? Même si je..."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: parker_boardgames/parker_beach_roller_swimsuit/15
msgctxt "Parker"
msgid "<i>Ahem.</i>"
msgstr "<i>Hem.</i>"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: parker_boardgames/parker_beach_roller_swimsuit/26
msgctxt "Parker"
msgid "I s-spun a..."
msgstr "J'ai o-obtenu un..."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: parker_boardgames/parker_beach_roller_swimsuit/35/b/1
msgctxt "Parker"
msgid "2... okay."
msgstr "2... bon."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: parker_boardgames/parker_beach_roller_swimsuit/36/b/1
msgctxt "Parker"
msgid "Oh jeez... bumped the spinner. Nerves I guess."
msgstr "Oh mince... j'ai cogné la roulette. Les nerfs, je suppose."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: parker_boardgames/parker_beach_roller_swimsuit/36/b/12
msgctxt "Parker"
msgid "That means as a penalty I can only move 1..."
msgstr "Ce qui veut dire qu'en pénalité, je ne peux avancer que d'une case..."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: parker_boardgames/parker_beach_roller_swimsuit/37/b/1
msgctxt "Parker"
msgid "I can't spin this! Not while I'm dressed this way!"
msgstr "Je ne peux pas tourner ça ! Pas habillé comme ça !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: parker_boardgames/parker_beach_roller_swimsuit/37/b/12
msgctxt "Parker"
msgid "I'm gonna put on my clothes again, and it'll be your turn next."
msgstr "Je vais remettre mes vêtements, et ce sera ensuite ton tour."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: parker_boardgames/parker_beach_roller_swimsuit/37/b/20 parker_boardgames/player_wins_beach_swimsuit/0/0
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Parker does a magnificent spin, changing out of his swimsuit and back into his normal board-game themed attire with more pizzazz than you'd have given him credit for."
msgstr "Parker fait un tour sur lui-même magnifique, troquant son maillot de bain contre sa tenue habituelle à thème jeux de société avec plus de panache que vous ne lui en auriez prêté."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: parker_boardgames/parker_beach_roller_swimsuit/38/b/1
msgctxt "Parker"
msgid "Looks like it's a measly 1..."
msgstr "On dirait que ça ne fait qu'un maigre 1..."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: parker_boardgames/parker_beach_roller_swimsuit/38/b/9
msgctxt "Parker"
msgid "Get it together, Parker!"
msgstr "Ressaisis-toi, Parker !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: parker_boardgames/parker_beach_roller_swimsuit/39/b/1
msgctxt "Parker"
msgid "A two, huh? Not too good... not too good."
msgstr "Un deux, hein ? Pas terrible... pas terrible."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: parker_boardgames/parker_beach_roller_swimsuit/39/b/9
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Parker raises his hands slowly to his chest, covering himself up with an awkward sort of modesty."
msgstr "Parker lève lentement les mains vers sa poitrine, se couvrant avec une sorte de pudeur gênée."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: parker_boardgames/parker_beach_roller_swimsuit/39/b/17
msgctxt "Parker"
msgid "You're not... looking at my nipples, are you? I know I would if I were you."
msgstr "Tu ne regardes pas... mes tétons, n'est-ce pas ? Moi, je le ferais à ta place."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: parker_boardgames/parker_beach_roller_swimsuit/39/b/25
msgctxt "Parker"
msgid "I'm looking at them now."
msgstr "Je les regarde en ce moment même."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: parker_boardgames/parker_board_outcome_swimsuit/0/b/5
msgctxt "Parker"
msgid "Okay so the delicious ice cream is filling me with joy. I'll be able to move again after this turn."
msgstr "Bon, alors la délicieuse glace m'emplit de joie. Je pourrai rebouger après ce tour."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: parker_boardgames/parker_board_outcome_swimsuit/0/b/13
msgctxt "Parker"
msgid "Uh, Looks like it's back to you!"
msgstr "Euh, on dirait que c'est de nouveau à toi !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: parker_boardgames/parker_board_outcome_swimsuit/3/b/1
msgctxt "Parker"
msgid "Okay... I'm on the first space - traffic! Tough to get out of..."
msgstr "Bon... je suis sur la première case : les embouteillages ! Difficile d'en sortir..."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: parker_boardgames/parker_board_outcome_swimsuit/4/b/1
msgctxt "Parker"
msgid "Hmph. I'm on the second space - The Parking Lot Entrance! With the high fees at the beach I'll have to move back one space to find a better price..."
msgstr "Hmpf. Je suis sur la deuxième case : l'Entrée du Parking ! Avec les tarifs exorbitants de la plage, je dois reculer d'une case pour trouver un meilleur prix..."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: parker_boardgames/parker_board_outcome_swimsuit/5/b/1
msgctxt "Parker"
msgid "Looks like I'm on the third space - The Open Space at the Parking Lot! Not bad!"
msgstr "On dirait que je suis sur la troisième case : la Place Libre du Parking ! Pas mal !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: parker_boardgames/parker_board_outcome_swimsuit/6/b/1
msgctxt "Parker"
msgid "Uhhh... I'm on the fourth space - Getting Stuff Out of the Car! Good thing I brought the sunscreen!"
msgstr "Euuuh... je suis sur la quatrième case : Sortir les Affaires de la Voiture ! Heureusement que j'ai pris la crème solaire !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: parker_boardgames/parker_board_outcome_swimsuit/7/b/1
msgctxt "Parker"
msgid "Okay okay okay I'm on the fifth space - Hot Sand! The intense heat on the soles of my feet cause me to run forward three spaces! Ow, ow ow, OW!"
msgstr "Bon bon bon, je suis sur la cinquième case : Sable Brûlant ! La chaleur intense sous la plante de mes pieds me fait courir de trois cases en avant ! Aïe, aïe aïe, AÏE !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: parker_boardgames/parker_board_outcome_swimsuit/7/b/12
msgctxt "Parker"
msgid "Boy did I need that..."
msgstr "Ça, j'en avais bien besoin..."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: parker_boardgames/parker_board_outcome_swimsuit/8/b/1
msgctxt "Parker"
msgid "I'm on the sixth space - Ice Cream! Oh gosh I can't help but stop for a tasty treat, and I lose a turn!"
msgstr "Je suis sur la sixième case : Glace ! Oh là là, je ne peux pas m'empêcher de m'arrêter pour une gourmandise, et je perds un tour !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: parker_boardgames/parker_board_outcome_swimsuit/9/b/1
msgctxt "Parker"
msgid "I'm on the seventh space - Looking for a Sunny Spot! It sure is crowded today... Everyone's looking at me. Just like that dream I keep having."
msgstr "Je suis sur la septième case : À la Recherche d'un Coin Ensoleillé ! Il y a un monde fou aujourd'hui... Tout le monde me regarde. Comme dans ce rêve que je fais tout le temps."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: parker_boardgames/parker_board_outcome_swimsuit/10/b/1
msgctxt "Parker"
msgid "Phew... I'm on the eighth space - The Perfect Spot! Now to set up my blanket..."
msgstr "Ouf... je suis sur la huitième case : L'Endroit Parfait ! Il ne reste plus qu'à installer ma serviette..."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: parker_boardgames/parker_board_outcome_swimsuit/11/b/1
msgctxt "Parker"
msgid "Oh dear oh dear I'm on the ninth space - Loud Music Family! I'm set up next to a family blasting tunes - looks like I'll have to go back two spaces to find another spot!"
msgstr "Oh là là, oh là là, je suis sur la neuvième case : La Famille au Son Trop Fort ! Je me suis installé à côté d'une famille qui hurle sa musique : je dois reculer de deux cases pour trouver une autre place !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: parker_boardgames/parker_board_outcome_swimsuit/12/b/1
msgctxt "Parker"
msgid "Ah! I'm on the tenth space - Big Bad Sun! I didn't bring sunscreen out of the car! I have to go back all the way to space 4... oh dear!"
msgstr "Ah ! Je suis sur la dixième case : Le Grand Méchant Soleil ! Je n'ai pas sorti la crème solaire de la voiture ! Je dois retourner jusqu'à la case 4... Oh là là !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: parker_boardgames/parker_board_outcome_swimsuit/13/b/1
msgctxt "Parker"
msgid "Oh thank goodness... I'm on the tenth space - Big Bad Sun! Good thing I brought the sunscreen out of the car! I move forward one space! Maybe you can help me get the hard-to-reach spots."
msgstr "Ouf, Dieu merci... je suis sur la dixième case : Le Grand Méchant Soleil ! Heureusement que j'ai sorti la crème solaire de la voiture ! J'avance d'une case ! Peut-être que tu pourrais m'aider pour les endroits difficiles à atteindre."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: parker_boardgames/parker_board_outcome_swimsuit/14/b/1
msgctxt "Parker"
msgid "Hey... I'm on the eleventh space - Notifications Off! I'm almost to a perfect Sandy Holiday!"
msgstr "Hé... je suis sur la onzième case : Notifications Coupées ! Je suis presque à des Vacances de Sable parfaites !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: parker_boardgames/parker_board_outcome_swimsuit/15/b/1
msgctxt "Parker"
msgid "I... I can't believe it! I made it to the Sandy Kingdom half-naked! Ha ha! I win!"
msgstr "Je... je n'en reviens pas ! J'ai atteint le Royaume de Sable à moitié nu ! Ha ha ! Je gagne !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: parker_boardgames/player_wins_beach_swimsuit/0/14
msgctxt "Parker"
msgid "I tried my best, but I can't help but feel that your idea to strip to our skivvies gave me a rough go... I didn't LIKE it!"
msgstr "J'ai fait de mon mieux, mais je ne peux m'empêcher de penser que ton idée de se mettre en sous-vêtements m'a bien compliqué la tâche... Je n'ai PAS AIMÉ ça !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: parker_boardgames/player_wins_beach_swimsuit/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Parker"
msgid "Oh, it doesn't matter if you're mean to me or gloat - I'll still love you if you roll a love ending with me!"
msgstr "Oh, peu importe que tu sois méchant avec moi ou que tu te vantes : je t'aimerai quand même si tu obtiens une fin Amour avec moi !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: parker_boardgames/player_wins_beach_swimsuit/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Parker"
msgid "I'm proud of you. And now you get to enjoy the beach!"
msgstr "Je suis fier de toi. Et maintenant, tu vas pouvoir profiter de la plage !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: parker_boardgames/player_wins_beach_swimsuit/0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Parker"
msgid "Well... it was! Games can be all about luck!"
msgstr "Eh bien... elle l'était ! Les jeux peuvent être une pure affaire de chance !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: parker_boardgames/player_wins_beach_swimsuit/0/g-0/11
msgctxt "Parker"
msgid "Come see me next time... for the ancient game of Chess..."
msgstr "Viens me voir la prochaine fois... pour l'antique jeu d'Échecs..."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: parker_boardgames/parker_wins_beach_swimsuit/0/0
msgctxt "Parker"
msgid "Wow! I can't wait to put my clothes back on. All this... nudity makes me... ulp."
msgstr "Ouah ! J'ai hâte de remettre mes vêtements. Toute cette... nudité me fait... glups."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: parker_boardgames/parker_wins_beach_swimsuit/0/8
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Parker spins, looking for a moment like a spinner in one of his beloved board games, and his clothing magically appears once more. He seems much calmer now."
msgstr "Parker tourne sur lui-même, ressemblant un instant à une roulette de l'un de ses jeux de société adorés, et ses vêtements réapparaissent comme par magie. Il semble beaucoup plus calme maintenant."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: parker_boardgames/parker_wins_beach_swimsuit/0/22
msgctxt "Parker"
msgid "Yowzers!"
msgstr "Ouahou !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: parker_boardgames/parker_wins_beach_swimsuit/0/30
msgctxt "Parker"
msgid "The body is filled with sin."
msgstr "Le corps est plein de péché."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: parker_boardgames/parker_chess/0/6
msgctxt "Parker"
msgid "Welcome to the abode of mysteries... where today we will play the ancient game of Chess!"
msgstr "Bienvenue dans la demeure des mystères... où nous jouerons aujourd'hui à l'antique jeu d'Échecs !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: parker_boardgames/parker_chess/0/14
msgctxt "Parker"
msgid "First founded as the Indian game known as chaturanga before the 600s anno domini..."
msgstr "Né du jeu indien appelé chaturanga avant les années 600 après Jésus-Christ..."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: parker_boardgames/parker_chess/0/22
msgctxt "Parker"
msgid "That's 'year of our lord <w>CHRIST'</w>."
msgstr "Ça veut dire « l'an de notre Seigneur <w>CHRIST</w> »."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: parker_boardgames/parker_chess/0/33
msgctxt "Parker"
msgid "...it traveled throughout space and time to reach us today as the most popular board game of all."
msgstr "...il a voyagé à travers l'espace et le temps pour nous parvenir aujourd'hui comme le plus populaire de tous les jeux de société."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: parker_boardgames/parker_chess/0/41
msgctxt "Parker"
msgid "The game used to have elephants for pieces, but now it's like bishops and stuff."
msgstr "Le jeu avait des éléphants comme pièces, mais maintenant c'est plutôt des fous et des trucs comme ça."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: parker_boardgames/parker_chess/0/49
msgctxt "Parker"
msgid "Do you know how to play?"
msgstr "Tu sais jouer ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: parker_boardgames/parker_chess/0/57/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I do!"
msgstr "Oui !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: parker_boardgames/parker_chess/0/58/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "No, I don't."
msgstr "Non, je ne sais pas."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: parker_boardgames/parker_chess/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Parker"
msgid "That's great. Saves me an explanation!"
msgstr "Parfait. Ça m'évite une explication !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: parker_boardgames/parker_chess/0/c-1/11
msgctxt "Parker"
msgid "That's okay. All you'll need to know is you want to trap my king in what is known as 'checkmate'."
msgstr "Ce n'est pas grave. Tout ce que tu dois savoir, c'est qu'il faut piéger mon roi dans ce qu'on appelle un « échec et mat »."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: parker_boardgames/parker_chess/0/c-1/19
msgctxt "Parker"
msgid "If you develop your pieces out into the center of the board and pay attention, those are all the tips you'll need to start off."
msgstr "Si tu développes tes pièces vers le centre du plateau et que tu restes attentif{{|ve|·ve}}, ce sont tous les conseils dont tu auras besoin pour débuter."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: parker_boardgames/parker_chess/0/c-1/27
msgctxt "Parker"
msgid "But I'm pretty good at chess I'll have you know, so it's not like you'll get me first time he laughs and scoffs."
msgstr "Mais je suis plutôt bon aux échecs, je te signale, donc ce n'est pas comme si tu allais m'avoir du premier coup, dit-il en riant et en ricanant."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: parker_boardgames/parker_chess/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Parker"
msgid "I have the pieces set up right here. You can be white, I'll be black, which means you go first."
msgstr "J'ai les pièces installées ici. Tu seras les blancs, moi les noirs, ce qui veut dire que tu commences."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: parker_boardgames/parker_chess/0/g-0/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "As my first move, I'll ask that we spice things up and play blindfolded..."
msgstr "Pour mon premier coup, je te demande de pimenter les choses et de jouer à l'aveugle..."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: parker_boardgames/parker_chess/0/g-0/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "<i>Switch the position of your king and queen.</i>"
msgstr "<i>Échanger la position de votre roi et de votre dame.</i>"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: parker_boardgames/parker_chess/0/g-0/10/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "<i>Play normally.</i>"
msgstr "<i>Jouer normalement.</i>"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: parker_boardgames/parker_chess/0/g-0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Parker"
msgid "B-blindfolded?"
msgstr "À l'a-aveugle ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: parker_boardgames/parker_chess/0/g-0/c-2/15
msgctxt "Parker"
msgid "S-spice things up??"
msgstr "P-pimenter les choses ??"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: parker_boardgames/parker_chess/0/g-0/c-2/23/b/1
msgctxt "Parker"
msgid "This is just like that dratted swimsuit you suggested I wear."
msgstr "C'est exactement comme ce maudit maillot de bain que tu m'as proposé de mettre."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: parker_boardgames/parker_chess/0/g-0/c-2/23/b/9
msgctxt "Parker"
msgid "I won't let this sort of intimacy shake me this time! No, not I... Parker \"Unshakeable\" Bradley!"
msgstr "Je ne me laisserai pas déstabiliser par ce genre d'intimité cette fois ! Non, pas moi... Parker « l'Inébranlable » Bradley !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: parker_boardgames/parker_chess/0/g-0/c-2/24/b/1
msgctxt "Parker"
msgid "I... well. I suppose I can do that... I can keep many positions in my noggin. I will be able to do just fine!"
msgstr "Je... enfin. Je suppose que je peux le faire... je peux garder plein de positions dans ma caboche. Je m'en sortirai très bien !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: parker_boardgames/parker_chess/0/g-0/c-3/11
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Swiftly, you surreptitiously exchange the position of your king and queen. They are similar enough and close enough to each other that it is difficult to notice without a practiced eye..."
msgstr "Prestement, vous échangez discrètement la position de votre roi et de votre dame. Ils se ressemblent assez et sont assez proches l'un de l'autre pour que ce soit difficile à remarquer sans un oeil exercé..."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: parker_boardgames/parker_chess/0/g-0/c-4/7
msgctxt "Parker"
msgid "Hm... this is the style of play that I would categorize as... <i>normal</i>."
msgstr "Hm... voilà le style de jeu que je qualifierais de... <i>normal</i>."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: parker_boardgames/chess_normal/0/0
msgctxt "Parker"
msgid "But what if I attacked you... like so?"
msgstr "Mais et si je t'attaquais... comme ça ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: parker_boardgames/chess_normal/0/8
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Parker pushes his knight far out into the playing field, seemingly completely undefended."
msgstr "Parker pousse son cavalier loin dans le champ de jeu, apparemment complètement sans défense."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: parker_boardgames/chess_normal/0/13/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "<i>Take the knight.</i>"
msgstr "<i>Prendre le cavalier.</i>"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: parker_boardgames/chess_normal/0/14/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "<i>Ignore the knight.</i>"
msgstr "<i>Ignorer le cavalier.</i>"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: parker_boardgames/chess_normal/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Parker watches your move with a malevolent glee, barking out a triumphant laugh."
msgstr "Parker observe votre coup avec une joie malveillante et lâche un rire triomphant."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: parker_boardgames/chess_normal/0/c-0/15
msgctxt "Parker"
msgid "Hah! You fell for such a simple opening trap!"
msgstr "Hah ! Tu es tombé{{|e|·e}} dans un piège d'ouverture aussi simple !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: parker_boardgames/chess_normal/0/c-0/23
msgctxt "Parker"
msgid "You think I'm bad at chess?"
msgstr "Tu crois que je suis nul aux échecs ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: parker_boardgames/chess_normal/0/c-0/31
msgctxt "Parker"
msgid "I've got a fucking pawn on my goddamn head, bitch!"
msgstr "J'ai un putain de pion sur ma foutue tête, tu sais !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: parker_boardgames/chess_normal/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Parker"
msgid "All right, so you didn't fall for my opening trap. I have more tricks up my sleeve..."
msgstr "Très bien, tu n'es donc pas tombé{{|e|·e}} dans mon piège d'ouverture. J'ai d'autres tours dans mon sac..."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: parker_boardgames/chess_normal/0/c-1/18
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Parker plays chaotically, filling your position with wild sacrifices."
msgstr "Parker joue de façon chaotique, remplissant votre position de sacrifices sauvages."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: parker_boardgames/chess_normal/0/c-1/26
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "One such sacrifice leaves a set of his pawns doubled up on the same file, one in front of the other."
msgstr "L'un de ces sacrifices laisse une série de ses pions doublés sur la même colonne, l'un devant l'autre."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: parker_boardgames/chess_normal/0/c-1/34
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "His tactic-filled play also leaves his king wide open, easy to attack."
msgstr "Son jeu plein de tactiques laisse aussi son roi grand ouvert, facile à attaquer."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: parker_boardgames/chess_normal/0/c-1/42/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "<i>Focus on the doubled pawns.</i>"
msgstr "<i>Se concentrer sur les pions doublés.</i>"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: parker_boardgames/chess_normal/0/c-1/42/c-0/7
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Quietly, simply, you begin to bring your pieces one after the other upon the pawns that are incapable of defending themselves."
msgstr "Calmement, simplement, vous commencez à amener vos pièces les unes après les autres sur les pions incapables de se défendre."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: parker_boardgames/chess_normal/0/c-1/42/c-0/12
msgctxt "Parker"
msgid "Oooh... that's not very nice."
msgstr "Oooh... ce n'est pas très gentil."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: parker_boardgames/chess_normal/0/c-1/42/c-0/20
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Parker puts his queen next to your king in a very threatening manner, maintaining eye contact with you all the while. He does not blink."
msgstr "Parker place sa dame à côté de votre roi d'une manière très menaçante, sans jamais rompre le contact visuel. Il ne cligne pas des yeux."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: parker_boardgames/chess_normal/0/c-1/42/c-0/28/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "<i>Keep focusing on the doubled pawns.</i>"
msgstr "<i>Continuer à se concentrer sur les pions doublés.</i>"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: parker_boardgames/chess_normal/0/c-1/42/c-0/28/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "<i>Attack his queen right back.</i>"
msgstr "<i>Attaquer sa dame en retour.</i>"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: parker_boardgames/chess_normal/0/c-1/42/c-0/28/c-0/7
msgctxt "Parker"
msgid "Drat! Drat! Drat!"
msgstr "Zut ! Zut ! Zut !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: parker_boardgames/chess_normal/0/c-1/42/c-0/28/c-0/18
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "The single weak point of his pawns begins to crumble, and soon, his entire position with it."
msgstr "Le seul point faible de ses pions commence à s'effondrer, et bientôt toute sa position avec lui."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: parker_boardgames/chess_normal/0/c-1/42/c-0/28/c-0/26
msgctxt "Parker"
msgid "Oh dear..."
msgstr "Oh là là..."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: parker_boardgames/chess_normal/0/c-1/42/c-0/28/c-0/37
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "You begin to control more and more of the board as the ranks and files open up, and his king is quickly placed into a corner with only a single rook remaining on his side."
msgstr "Vous contrôlez de plus en plus le plateau à mesure que les rangées et les colonnes s'ouvrent, et son roi est vite acculé dans un coin avec une seule tour restante de son côté."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: parker_boardgames/chess_normal/0/c-1/42/c-0/28/c-0/45
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Parker quietly moves his last rook just to the side of your queen."
msgstr "Parker déplace tranquillement sa dernière tour juste à côté de votre dame."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: parker_boardgames/chess_normal/0/c-1/42/c-0/28/c-0/53/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "<i>Take the rook.</i>"
msgstr "<i>Prendre la tour.</i>"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: parker_boardgames/chess_normal/0/c-1/42/c-0/28/c-0/53/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "<i>Go after his king.</i>"
msgstr "<i>S'en prendre à son roi.</i>"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: parker_boardgames/chess_normal/0/c-1/42/c-0/28/c-0/53/c-0/7
msgctxt "Parker"
msgid "Stalemate!"
msgstr "Pat !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: parker_boardgames/chess_normal/0/c-1/42/c-0/28/c-0/53/c-0/15
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "With his last movable piece gone, Parker cannot make any more legal moves without checkmating himself. The game swiftly ends in a draw."
msgstr "Sa dernière pièce mobile ayant disparu, Parker ne peut plus jouer de coup légal sans se mettre lui-même échec et mat. La partie se termine rapidement par une nulle."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: parker_boardgames/chess_normal/0/c-1/42/c-0/28/c-0/53/c-0/23
msgctxt "Parker"
msgid "Them's the rules!"
msgstr "Ce sont les règles !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: parker_boardgames/chess_normal/0/c-1/42/c-0/28/c-0/53/c-0/31/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Does a draw count as a win?"
msgstr "Une nulle compte comme une victoire ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: parker_boardgames/chess_normal/0/c-1/42/c-0/28/c-0/53/c-0/31/c-0/7
msgctxt "Parker"
msgid "Nope!"
msgstr "Non !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: parker_boardgames/chess_normal/0/c-1/42/c-0/28/c-0/53/c-0/31/c-0/15
msgctxt "Parker"
msgid "Drawing from a losing position takes some skill! Gimme some credit!"
msgstr "Obtenir la nulle depuis une position perdante demande du talent ! Un peu de crédit !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: parker_boardgames/chess_normal/0/c-1/42/c-0/28/c-0/53/c-0/31/c-0/23
msgctxt "Parker"
msgid "You get no points towards my love! <w>Pbbbt!</w>"
msgstr "Tu n'as aucun point vers mon amour ! <w>Pfffft !</w>"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: parker_boardgames/chess_normal/0/c-1/42/c-0/28/c-0/53/c-1/7
msgctxt "Parker"
msgid "No! My last trick!"
msgstr "Non ! Mon dernier tour !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: parker_boardgames/chess_normal/0/c-1/42/c-0/28/c-0/53/c-1/18/0/s/0 parker_boardgames/parker_proceeds/0/c-1/33/c-0/34/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Checkmate!"
msgstr "Échec et mat !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: parker_boardgames/chess_normal/0/c-1/42/c-0/28/c-0/53/c-1/18/c-0/7 parker_boardgames/euro_middle/0/g-0/8
msgctxt "Parker"
msgid "Well done!"
msgstr "Bien joué !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: parker_boardgames/chess_normal/0/c-1/42/c-0/28/c-0/53/c-1/18/c-0/18
msgctxt "Parker"
msgid "You bested me in the classic game... the Game of Kings!"
msgstr "Tu m'as battu au jeu classique... le Jeu des Rois !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: parker_boardgames/chess_normal/0/c-1/42/c-0/28/c-0/53/c-1/18/c-0/26
msgctxt "Parker"
msgid "And for that, you earn a point towards my love... the ultimate reward..."
msgstr "Et pour cela, tu gagnes un point vers mon amour... la récompense ultime..."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: parker_boardgames/chess_normal/0/c-1/42/c-0/28/c-0/53/c-1/18/c-0/34/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Nice!"
msgstr "Super !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: parker_boardgames/chess_normal/0/c-1/42/c-0/28/c-0/53/c-1/18/c-0/34/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I don't want your love, dude..."
msgstr "Je ne veux pas de ton amour, tu sais..."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: parker_boardgames/chess_normal/0/c-1/42/c-0/28/c-0/53/c-1/18/c-0/34/c-1/7
msgctxt "Parker"
msgid "Of course you don't. Who does?"
msgstr "Bien sûr que non. Qui en voudrait ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: parker_boardgames/chess_normal/0/c-1/42/c-0/28/c-0/53/c-1/18/c-0/34/g-0/0 parker_boardgames/parker_proceeds/0/c-1/33/c-0/34/g-0/0 parker_boardgames/chess_blindfold/0/g-0/c-3/90/g-0/65 parker_boardgames/chess_blindfold/0/g-1/c-8/34/c-0/42 parker_boardgames/chess_cheater/0/g-0/c-4/34/c-0/31
msgctxt "Parker"
msgid "Still..."
msgstr "Pourtant..."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: parker_boardgames/chess_normal/0/c-1/42/c-0/28/c-1/7
msgctxt "Parker"
msgid "Ha! That was the bait!"
msgstr "Ha ! C'était l'appât !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: parker_boardgames/parker_proceeds/0/0
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Parker proceeds to wipe the board with your pieces, outplaying you move after move."
msgstr "Parker essuie le plateau avec vos pièces, vous surpassant coup après coup."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: parker_boardgames/parker_proceeds/0/8/s/0 parker_boardgames/chess_blindfold/0/g-0/c-3/90/2/s/0 parker_boardgames/chess_cheater/0/g-0/c-4/34/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "<i>Resign.</i>"
msgstr "<i>Abandonner.</i>"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: parker_boardgames/parker_proceeds/0/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "<i>Put back a bishop when he isn't looking.</i>"
msgstr "<i>Remettre un fou quand il ne regarde pas.</i>"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: parker_boardgames/parker_proceeds/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Parker"
msgid "Hmph. That was the best move you made all game."
msgstr "Hmpf. C'est le meilleur coup que tu aies joué de toute la partie."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: parker_boardgames/parker_proceeds/0/c-0/15 parker_boardgames/chess_blindfold/0/g-0/c-3/90/c-2/15 parker_boardgames/chess_cheater/0/g-0/c-4/34/c-1/15
msgctxt "Parker"
msgid "Well. I accept."
msgstr "Eh bien. J'accepte."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: parker_boardgames/parker_proceeds/0/c-0/23/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "That was fast..."
msgstr "C'était rapide..."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: parker_boardgames/parker_proceeds/0/c-0/23/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I feel like you cheated..."
msgstr "J'ai l'impression que tu as triché..."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: parker_boardgames/parker_proceeds/0/c-0/23/c-0/7
msgctxt "Parker"
msgid "That's what they all say!"
msgstr "C'est ce que tout le monde dit !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: parker_boardgames/parker_proceeds/0/c-0/23/c-1/7
msgctxt "Parker"
msgid "I <i>never</i> cheat."
msgstr "Je ne triche <i>jamais</i>."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: parker_boardgames/parker_proceeds/0/c-0/23/g-0/0
msgctxt "Parker"
msgid "Anyway, you don't get any extra points towards my love."
msgstr "Quoi qu'il en soit, tu n'obtiens aucun point supplémentaire vers mon amour."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: parker_boardgames/parker_proceeds/0/c-0/23/g-0/8 parker_boardgames/chess_blindfold/0/g-0/c-3/90/c-2/42/g-0/8 parker_boardgames/chess_cheater/0/g-0/c-4/34/c-1/34/g-0/8
msgctxt "Parker"
msgid "Pity!"
msgstr "Dommage !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: parker_boardgames/parker_proceeds/0/c-1/11
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "With an almost practiced ease, you bring a lost bishop out of your pocket and place it back on the board at random. Parker doesn't seem to notice... it looks as if you've gotten away with it."
msgstr "Avec une aisance presque rodée, vous sortez de votre poche un fou perdu et le replacez au hasard sur le plateau. Parker ne semble pas remarquer... on dirait que vous vous en êtes tiré{{|e|·e}}."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: parker_boardgames/parker_proceeds/0/c-1/25
msgctxt "Parker"
msgid "Do your worst!"
msgstr "Fais de ton pire !"

#: parker_boardgames/parker_proceeds/0/c-1/33/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "<i>Attack using the newly placed bishop.</i>"
msgstr ""

#: parker_boardgames/parker_proceeds/0/c-1/33/c-0/7
msgctxt "Parker"
msgid "Oh... my goodness!"
msgstr ""

#: parker_boardgames/parker_proceeds/0/c-1/33/c-0/15
msgctxt "Parker"
msgid "I didn't notice that was there!"
msgstr ""

#: parker_boardgames/parker_proceeds/0/c-1/33/c-0/23
msgctxt "Parker"
msgid "Don't... no!"
msgstr ""

#: parker_boardgames/parker_proceeds/0/c-1/33/c-0/34/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "It was nothing..."
msgstr ""

#: parker_boardgames/parker_proceeds/0/c-1/33/c-0/34/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I don't need your love!"
msgstr ""

#: parker_boardgames/parker_proceeds/0/c-1/33/c-0/34/3/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What if I cheated..."
msgstr ""

#: parker_boardgames/parker_proceeds/0/c-1/33/c-0/34/c-0/7
msgctxt "Parker"
msgid "I guess I fell for the trap in the end..."
msgstr ""

#: parker_boardgames/parker_proceeds/0/c-1/33/c-0/34/c-0/15
msgctxt "Parker"
msgid "I can't believe I didn't notice that bishop..."
msgstr ""

#: parker_boardgames/parker_proceeds/0/c-1/33/c-0/34/c-0/23
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Parker stares at you in silence for a few painfully long moments."
msgstr ""

#: parker_boardgames/parker_proceeds/0/c-1/33/c-0/34/c-0/31
msgctxt "Parker"
msgid "Well."
msgstr ""

#: parker_boardgames/parker_proceeds/0/c-1/33/c-0/34/c-0/39
msgctxt "Parker"
msgid "What I love about chess is there's always something new to learn!"
msgstr ""

#: parker_boardgames/parker_proceeds/0/c-1/33/c-0/34/c-0/47
msgctxt "Parker"
msgid "Congratulations! You win a point toward my love!"
msgstr ""

#: parker_boardgames/parker_proceeds/0/c-1/33/c-0/34/c-1/7
msgctxt "Parker"
msgid "It was one hell of a game!"
msgstr ""

#: parker_boardgames/parker_proceeds/0/c-1/33/c-0/34/c-2/7
msgctxt "Parker"
msgid "Doesn't matter! If you roll for it, you'll get it anyway!"
msgstr ""

#: parker_boardgames/parker_proceeds/0/c-1/33/c-0/34/c-3/7
msgctxt "Parker"
msgid "Oh, don't say that."
msgstr ""

#: parker_boardgames/parker_proceeds/0/c-1/33/c-0/34/c-3/15
msgctxt "Parker"
msgid "I know you would never cheat."
msgstr ""

#: parker_boardgames/chess_blindfold/0/7
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Parker gives you a chess blindfold and puts one on himself. You can no longer see the pieces, but you will be able to feel your way around the board."
msgstr ""

#: parker_boardgames/chess_blindfold/0/15
msgctxt "Parker"
msgid "Go ahead - make the first move."
msgstr ""

#: parker_boardgames/chess_blindfold/0/23/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "<i>Develop your pieces toward the center.</i>"
msgstr ""

#: parker_boardgames/chess_blindfold/0/24/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "<i>Sacrifice a pawn immediately in a gambit.</i>"
msgstr ""

#: parker_boardgames/chess_blindfold/0/25/s/0 parker_boardgames/chess_blindfold/0/g-0/19/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "<i>Play randomly.</i>"
msgstr ""

#: parker_boardgames/chess_blindfold/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Parker"
msgid "Then I will develop around the sides in a hypermodern style!"
msgstr ""

#: parker_boardgames/chess_blindfold/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Parker"
msgid "Oh, you won't be winning that pawn back any time soon..."
msgstr ""

#: parker_boardgames/chess_blindfold/0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Parker"
msgid "Hmm... this must be some deep preparation...."
msgstr ""

#: parker_boardgames/chess_blindfold/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Parker"
msgid "I move... here!"
msgstr ""

#: parker_boardgames/chess_blindfold/0/g-0/8
msgctxt "Parker"
msgid "What say you?"
msgstr ""

#: parker_boardgames/chess_blindfold/0/g-0/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "<i>Brush Parker's hand with yours.</i>"
msgstr ""

#: parker_boardgames/chess_blindfold/0/g-0/17/s/0 parker_boardgames/chess_cheater/0/40/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "<i>Play aggressively.</i>"
msgstr ""

#: parker_boardgames/chess_blindfold/0/g-0/18/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "<i>Play passively.</i>"
msgstr ""

#: parker_boardgames/chess_blindfold/0/g-0/c-3/7
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "You feign reaching for a chess piece, going directly for Parker's hand instead. When your hand brushes his you can hear him gasp and tremble."
msgstr ""

#: parker_boardgames/chess_blindfold/0/g-0/c-3/15
msgctxt "Parker"
msgid "<i>gasp!</i>"
msgstr ""

#: parker_boardgames/chess_blindfold/0/g-0/c-3/23
msgctxt "Parker"
msgid "Oh... uh uhm. Apologies."
msgstr ""

#: parker_boardgames/chess_blindfold/0/g-0/c-3/31
msgctxt "Parker"
msgid "I didn't mean to..."
msgstr ""

#: parker_boardgames/chess_blindfold/0/g-0/c-3/42
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "You can't see him, but you can practically <i>hear</i> how red he's turning."
msgstr ""

#: parker_boardgames/chess_blindfold/0/g-0/c-3/50
msgctxt "Parker"
msgid "<i>Ahem</i>"
msgstr ""

#: parker_boardgames/chess_blindfold/0/g-0/c-3/58
msgctxt "Parker"
msgid "Oh drat I've lost the position..."
msgstr ""

#: parker_boardgames/chess_blindfold/0/g-0/c-3/66
msgctxt "Parker"
msgid "Ummm..."
msgstr ""

#: parker_boardgames/chess_blindfold/0/g-0/c-3/74
msgctxt "Parker"
msgid "I'll move my bishop... here?"
msgstr ""

#: parker_boardgames/chess_blindfold/0/g-0/c-3/82
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Parker moves his bishop to a rather vulnerable spot - you can visualize it in your mind's eye."
msgstr ""

#: parker_boardgames/chess_blindfold/0/g-0/c-3/90/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "<i>Take the bishop.</i>"
msgstr ""

#: parker_boardgames/chess_blindfold/0/g-0/c-3/90/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "<i>Let the bishop go and move toward his king.</i>"
msgstr ""

#: parker_boardgames/chess_blindfold/0/g-0/c-3/90/c-0/7
msgctxt "Parker"
msgid "Oh dear! I thought I had that right..."
msgstr ""

#: parker_boardgames/chess_blindfold/0/g-0/c-3/90/c-1/7
msgctxt "Parker"
msgid "Oh no... that puts you far too close for comfort."
msgstr ""

#: parker_boardgames/chess_blindfold/0/g-0/c-3/90/c-2/7
msgctxt "Parker"
msgid "You... resigned??"
msgstr ""

#: parker_boardgames/chess_blindfold/0/g-0/c-3/90/c-2/23
msgctxt "Parker"
msgid "That blindfold was awfully difficult to play with."
msgstr ""

#: parker_boardgames/chess_blindfold/0/g-0/c-3/90/c-2/31 parker_boardgames/chess_blindfold/0/g-0/c-3/90/g-0/43 parker_boardgames/chess_blindfold/0/g-1/c-7/39 parker_boardgames/chess_blindfold/0/g-1/c-8/34/c-0/23 parker_boardgames/chess_blindfold/0/g-1/c-8/34/c-1/47
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "You both take off your blindfolds and gaze into each other's eyes—is this romance? Or is he trying to get a read on you? You're not certain either way..."
msgstr ""

#: parker_boardgames/chess_blindfold/0/g-0/c-3/90/c-2/42/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I agree... that was tough!"
msgstr ""

#: parker_boardgames/chess_blindfold/0/g-0/c-3/90/c-2/42/1/s/0 parker_boardgames/chess_cheater/0/g-0/c-4/34/c-1/34/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I felt bad for you!"
msgstr ""

#: parker_boardgames/chess_blindfold/0/g-0/c-3/90/c-2/42/c-0/7
msgctxt "Parker"
msgid "Excellent!"
msgstr ""

#: parker_boardgames/chess_blindfold/0/g-0/c-3/90/c-2/42/c-1/7 parker_boardgames/chess_cheater/0/g-0/c-4/34/c-1/34/c-1/7
msgctxt "Parker"
msgid "If only that mattered in how I felt about you... all I care about is winning!"
msgstr ""

#: parker_boardgames/chess_blindfold/0/g-0/c-3/90/c-2/42/g-0/0 parker_boardgames/chess_cheater/0/g-0/c-4/34/c-1/34/g-0/0
msgctxt "Parker"
msgid "Which means you don't get any extra love points in our ultimate relationship die."
msgstr ""

#: parker_boardgames/chess_blindfold/0/g-0/c-3/90/g-0/0
msgctxt "Parker"
msgid "I'll protect my king with my powerful queen!"
msgstr ""

#: parker_boardgames/chess_blindfold/0/g-0/c-3/90/g-0/8
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "It appears from Parker's last move that you can simply skewer his queen with your rook."
msgstr ""

#: parker_boardgames/chess_blindfold/0/g-0/c-3/90/g-0/16
msgctxt "Parker"
msgid "Yipes! No!"
msgstr ""

#: parker_boardgames/chess_blindfold/0/g-0/c-3/90/g-0/24
msgctxt "Parker"
msgid "I'll... take your rook then..."
msgstr ""

#: parker_boardgames/chess_blindfold/0/g-0/c-3/90/g-0/35
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "But it is too late. Parker's position has collapsed, and you checkmate him only a few moves later."
msgstr ""

#: parker_boardgames/chess_blindfold/0/g-0/c-3/90/g-0/54
msgctxt "Parker"
msgid "Congratulations! You've earned a point towards my love!"
msgstr ""

#: parker_boardgames/chess_blindfold/0/g-0/c-4/7
msgctxt "Parker"
msgid "Going for my throat, huh?"
msgstr ""

#: parker_boardgames/chess_blindfold/0/g-0/c-4/15 parker_boardgames/chess_cheater/0/c-0/15
msgctxt "Parker"
msgid "That means you'll be over-extended, and I can sneak in from your weak points!"
msgstr ""

#: parker_boardgames/chess_blindfold/0/g-0/c-5/7
msgctxt "Parker"
msgid "Hmm... I'll need to remember exactly where your position is so I can find the weak points..."
msgstr ""

#: parker_boardgames/chess_blindfold/0/g-0/c-6/7 parker_boardgames/chess_cheater/0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Parker"
msgid "I... can't seem to figure this out... Excellent positional play from my opponent..."
msgstr ""

#: parker_boardgames/chess_blindfold/0/g-1/0
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "It is difficult to tell with the blindfolds, but the position seems tense."
msgstr ""

#: parker_boardgames/chess_blindfold/0/g-1/8
msgctxt "Parker"
msgid "We're approaching the endgame..."
msgstr ""

#: parker_boardgames/chess_blindfold/0/g-1/16 parker_boardgames/chess_cheater/0/g-0/16
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Parker offers you a trade of pieces..."
msgstr ""

#: parker_boardgames/chess_blindfold/0/g-1/24/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "<i>Accept the trade and go towards a draw</i>"
msgstr ""

#: parker_boardgames/chess_blindfold/0/g-1/25/s/0 parker_boardgames/chess_cheater/0/g-0/25/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "<i>Refuse the trade and play for a win.</i>"
msgstr ""

#: parker_boardgames/chess_blindfold/0/g-1/c-7/7 parker_boardgames/chess_cheater/0/g-0/c-3/7
msgctxt "Parker"
msgid "Ah thank you! Now the position is much simpler for me to understand!"
msgstr ""

#: parker_boardgames/chess_blindfold/0/g-1/c-7/15 parker_boardgames/chess_cheater/0/g-0/c-3/15
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Parker's memory seems to double - and his moves come much faster, much more confidently."
msgstr ""

#: parker_boardgames/chess_blindfold/0/g-1/c-7/23 parker_boardgames/chess_blindfold/0/g-1/c-8/34/c-1/31 parker_boardgames/chess_cheater/0/g-0/c-3/23
msgctxt "Parker"
msgid "Checkmate!"
msgstr ""

#: parker_boardgames/chess_blindfold/0/g-1/c-7/31 parker_boardgames/chess_blindfold/0/g-1/c-8/34/c-1/39
msgctxt "Parker"
msgid "Haha! I won! Even with this dratted blindfold!"
msgstr ""

#: parker_boardgames/chess_blindfold/0/g-1/c-7/50 parker_boardgames/chess_blindfold/0/g-1/c-8/34/c-1/58 parker_boardgames/chess_cheater/0/g-0/c-3/39
msgctxt "Parker"
msgid "No love points for you!"
msgstr ""

#: parker_boardgames/chess_blindfold/0/g-1/c-8/7 parker_boardgames/chess_cheater/0/g-0/c-4/7
msgctxt "Parker"
msgid "Rrrr... you should have accepted that!"
msgstr ""

#: parker_boardgames/chess_blindfold/0/g-1/c-8/18 parker_boardgames/chess_cheater/0/g-0/c-4/18
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Parker's play becomes erratic - he was clearly hoping you would trade the pieces down to make the position simpler for him to keep in his mind."
msgstr ""

#: parker_boardgames/chess_blindfold/0/g-1/c-8/26
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "It's here that he makes what seems to be a grave mistake - could that be his rook ready for the taking?"
msgstr ""

#: parker_boardgames/chess_blindfold/0/g-1/c-8/34/0/s/0 parker_boardgames/chess_cheater/0/g-0/c-4/34/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "<i>Take his rook.</i>"
msgstr ""

#: parker_boardgames/chess_blindfold/0/g-1/c-8/34/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "<i>Refuse to take his rook</i>"
msgstr ""

#: parker_boardgames/chess_blindfold/0/g-1/c-8/34/c-0/7 parker_boardgames/chess_cheater/0/g-0/c-4/34/c-0/7
msgctxt "Parker"
msgid "Oh no!"
msgstr ""

#: parker_boardgames/chess_blindfold/0/g-1/c-8/34/c-0/15 parker_boardgames/chess_cheater/0/g-0/c-4/34/c-0/15
msgctxt "Parker"
msgid "...I resign..."
msgstr ""

#: parker_boardgames/chess_blindfold/0/g-1/c-8/34/c-0/31 parker_boardgames/chess_cheater/0/g-0/c-4/34/c-0/23
msgctxt "Parker"
msgid "Well done. You bested me in the classic game..."
msgstr ""

#: parker_boardgames/chess_blindfold/0/g-1/c-8/34/c-1/7
msgctxt "Parker"
msgid "Wait... was my... rook ready for the taking?"
msgstr ""

#: parker_boardgames/chess_blindfold/0/g-1/c-8/34/c-1/15
msgctxt "Parker"
msgid "Phew. You missed it!"
msgstr ""

#: parker_boardgames/chess_blindfold/0/g-1/c-8/34/c-1/23
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Parker confidently recalls the position."
msgstr ""

#: parker_boardgames/chess_cheater/0/0
msgctxt "Parker"
msgid "You'll never defeat my superior opening preparation!"
msgstr ""

#: parker_boardgames/chess_cheater/0/8
msgctxt "Parker"
msgid "I've memorized all the best moves from all the best players!"
msgstr ""

#: parker_boardgames/chess_cheater/0/16
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Parker plays his first ten moves extremely quickly, but then begins to pause."
msgstr ""

#: parker_boardgames/chess_cheater/0/24
msgctxt "Parker"
msgid "Wait a minute... I don't remember it being quite like this..."
msgstr ""

#: parker_boardgames/chess_cheater/0/32
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "His openings aren't lining up... he must be shaken."
msgstr ""

#: parker_boardgames/chess_cheater/0/41/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "<i>Play passively</i>"
msgstr ""

#: parker_boardgames/chess_cheater/0/42/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "<i>Play randomly</i>"
msgstr ""

#: parker_boardgames/chess_cheater/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Parker"
msgid "Going for my throat, eh?"
msgstr ""

#: parker_boardgames/chess_cheater/0/c-0/23
msgctxt "Parker"
msgid "Though... where are your weak points..."
msgstr ""

#: parker_boardgames/chess_cheater/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Parker"
msgid "Hmm... This is giving me a really hard time to find a way in..."
msgstr ""

#: parker_boardgames/chess_cheater/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Move by move, Parker's opening forcefulness seems to dwindle."
msgstr ""

#: parker_boardgames/chess_cheater/0/g-0/8
msgctxt "Parker"
msgid "We are approaching the endgame..."
msgstr ""

#: parker_boardgames/chess_cheater/0/g-0/24/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "<i>Accept the trade and go towards a draw.</i>"
msgstr ""

#: parker_boardgames/chess_cheater/0/g-0/c-3/31
msgctxt "Parker"
msgid "Haha! I won! Even with your confusing opening!"
msgstr ""

#: parker_boardgames/chess_cheater/0/g-0/c-4/26
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "It's here that he makes what seems to be a grave mistake - could that be, his rook ready for the taking?"
msgstr ""

#: parker_boardgames/chess_cheater/0/g-0/c-4/34/c-1/7
msgctxt "Parker"
msgid "You... resigned?? In such a winning position?"
msgstr ""

#: parker_boardgames/chess_cheater/0/g-0/c-4/34/c-1/23
msgctxt "Parker"
msgid "Your knowledge of opening theory was truly tremendous..."
msgstr ""

#: parker_boardgames/chess_cheater/0/g-0/c-4/34/c-1/34/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I agree..."
msgstr ""

#: parker_boardgames/chess_cheater/0/g-0/c-4/34/c-1/34/c-0/7
msgctxt "Parker"
msgid "Excellent work!"
msgstr ""

#: parker_boardgames/chess_player_wins/6 parker_boardgames/chess_parker_wins/0/g-0/8
msgctxt "Parker"
msgid "I will see you next time for an ever-so complex game with many of my beloved Rules!"
msgstr ""

#: parker_boardgames/chess_parker_wins/0/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Great, I don't want to fall in love with you."
msgstr ""

#: parker_boardgames/chess_parker_wins/0/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Aw man, but I like you, Parker!"
msgstr ""

#: parker_boardgames/chess_parker_wins/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Parker"
msgid "Ah, soon we will find out whether that plays out well for you..."
msgstr ""

#: parker_boardgames/parker_eurogame/0/6
msgctxt "Parker"
msgid "Today we will be playing a popular and complicated game! This is a game in the 'euro-game' tradition - one of resource allocation, worker placement, and cooperation between players!"
msgstr ""

#: parker_boardgames/parker_eurogame/0/14
msgctxt "Parker"
msgid "It's based on the 20th Century Dairy Wars between England, France, and Belgium, called \"Cream Capitalist\"."
msgstr ""

#: parker_boardgames/parker_eurogame/0/22
msgctxt "Parker"
msgid "We will both attempt to outproduce the cream that the other is attempting to make."
msgstr ""

#: parker_boardgames/parker_eurogame/0/38/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Sure..."
msgstr ""

#: parker_boardgames/parker_eurogame/0/39/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Nope, I'm good."
msgstr ""

#: parker_boardgames/parker_eurogame/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Parker"
msgid "I'm so excited to speak for a very long time!"
msgstr ""

#: parker_boardgames/parker_eurogame/0/c-0/18
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Parker does indeed speak for a very long time, spending roughly 45 minutes going into excruciating detail about the different rules and sub-rules for each scenario—including the expansions which, as far as you can tell, aren't being used."
msgstr ""

#: parker_boardgames/parker_eurogame/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Parker"
msgid "Your loss..."
msgstr ""

#: parker_boardgames/parker_eurogame/0/c-1/15
msgctxt "Parker"
msgid "How will you ever know whether your cream-skimmers are operating at peak efficiency?"
msgstr ""

#: parker_boardgames/parker_eurogame/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Parker"
msgid "I'll play as Belgium, which has a +3 bonus to currency exchange. Which means you can be either England or France."
msgstr ""

#: parker_boardgames/parker_eurogame/0/g-0/8
msgctxt "Parker"
msgid "Which will you choose?"
msgstr ""

#: parker_boardgames/parker_eurogame/0/g-0/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "England."
msgstr ""

#: parker_boardgames/parker_eurogame/0/g-0/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "France."
msgstr ""

#: parker_boardgames/parker_eurogame/0/g-0/18/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Belgium."
msgstr ""

#: parker_boardgames/parker_eurogame/0/g-0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Parker"
msgid "Huh! That's definitely a bad move!"
msgstr ""

#: parker_boardgames/parker_eurogame/0/g-0/c-2/15
msgctxt "Parker"
msgid "In the \"Cream Capitalist\" championships England is well known to be at a disadvantage because of the cow-wandering exploit. Think of the <w>exploit</w>!"
msgstr ""

#: parker_boardgames/parker_eurogame/0/g-0/c-3/7
msgctxt "Parker"
msgid "I knew you'd choose that! There's nothing interesting about France at all."
msgstr ""

#: parker_boardgames/parker_eurogame/0/g-0/c-3/15
msgctxt "Parker"
msgid "In the game or real life!"
msgstr ""

#: parker_boardgames/parker_eurogame/0/g-0/c-4/18
msgctxt "Parker"
msgid "...okay so you'll be France then."
msgstr ""

#: parker_boardgames/parker_eurogame/0/g-1/0/b/1
msgctxt "Parker"
msgid "And I can confidently say that there will be none of this tomfoolery getting my emotions all twisted up with your sexy situations!"
msgstr ""

#: parker_boardgames/parker_eurogame/0/g-1/0/b/9
msgctxt "Parker"
msgid "I will keep my emotions in check and my resources properly allocated!"
msgstr ""

#: parker_boardgames/parker_eurogame/0/g-1/3
msgctxt "Parker"
msgid "Begin!"
msgstr ""

#: parker_boardgames/parker_eurogame/0/g-1/11
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Parker distributes the pieces, a ten minute process."
msgstr ""

#: parker_boardgames/parker_eurogame/0/g-1/19
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "You receive 5 cards with various types of cream-making machinery on them, 6 Bulk Cooling Tank pieces, 24 Cream-maker Worker pieces, a Pasteurization token, and 8-9 things you can only describe as 'shapes'."
msgstr ""

#: parker_boardgames/parker_eurogame/0/g-1/24/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "<i>Place your pieces in little piles in front of you.</i>"
msgstr ""

#: parker_boardgames/parker_eurogame/0/g-1/25/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "<i>Think about the rules and begin to build a strategy.</i>"
msgstr ""

#: parker_boardgames/parker_eurogame/0/g-1/26/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "<i>Look over at Parker's resources and analyze them.</i>"
msgstr ""

#: parker_boardgames/parker_eurogame/0/g-1/27/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "<i>Use Carl card.</i>"
msgstr ""

#: parker_boardgames/parker_eurogame/0/g-1/c-5/13
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "The piles begin to look very nice, and the process soothes you."
msgstr ""

#: parker_boardgames/parker_eurogame/0/g-1/c-6/7
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Though the rules are intricate, they are no match for your intellect and resource-mongering capabilities."
msgstr ""

#: parker_boardgames/parker_eurogame/0/g-1/c-7/13
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "It appears that Belgium has slightly different calculations governing the way that their workers are spawned."
msgstr ""

#: parker_boardgames/parker_eurogame/0/g-1/c-7/18
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "In fact, the Belgium player should prioritize exchanging currencies to create new cards rather than spawning new factories."
msgstr ""

#: parker_boardgames/parker_eurogame/0/g-1/c-8/7
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "You produce the Carl card from your pocket."
msgstr ""

#: parker_boardgames/parker_eurogame/0/g-1/c-8/12
msgctxt "Parker"
msgid "Okay... you're gonna 'use the Carl card'..."
msgstr ""

#: parker_boardgames/parker_eurogame/0/g-1/c-8/23
msgctxt "Parker"
msgid "You've done so much weird shit to throw me off my game and now this—What is it? What is 'Carl card'?"
msgstr ""

#: parker_boardgames/parker_eurogame/0/g-1/c-8/34
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "You hand it to Parker without a word. He takes it from you, dread setting in slowly as he realizes what you've just done."
msgstr ""

#: parker_boardgames/parker_eurogame/0/g-1/c-8/42
msgctxt "Parker"
msgid "I'm gonna be real with you, you've done so much weird, freaky shit in the games that we've played, I... I emotionally I'm checked out. I don't know..."
msgstr ""

#: parker_boardgames/parker_eurogame/0/g-1/c-8/50
msgctxt "Parker"
msgid "Carl card frankly is the last card, it's the last straw for me dealing with you in this game, so I'm gonna give up, you win..."
msgstr ""

#: parker_boardgames/parker_eurogame/0/g-1/c-8/61
msgctxt "Parker"
msgid "Congratulations on your stupid card it that doesn't make any sense, uh, and I'm mad, and I'm having a bad time."
msgstr ""

#: parker_boardgames/parker_eurogame/0/g-1/c-8/75/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Really?"
msgstr ""

#: parker_boardgames/parker_eurogame/0/g-1/c-8/75/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Woohoo! Carl card!"
msgstr ""

#: parker_boardgames/parker_eurogame/0/g-1/c-8/75/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Damn, didn't think that would be all that powerful."
msgstr ""

#: parker_boardgames/parker_eurogame/0/g-1/c-8/75/c-0/7
msgctxt "Parker"
msgid "I just can't keep up with you."
msgstr ""

#: parker_boardgames/parker_eurogame/0/g-1/c-8/75/c-0/18
msgctxt "Parker"
msgid "You know, when I zig, you zag. And when I zag, you 'Carl card'."
msgstr ""

#: parker_boardgames/parker_eurogame/0/g-1/c-8/75/c-1/7
msgctxt "Parker"
msgid "Uh huh."
msgstr ""

#: parker_boardgames/parker_eurogame/0/g-1/c-8/75/c-2/7
msgctxt "Parker"
msgid "Sure. You picked the option that just seemed fair, yeah?"
msgstr ""

#: parker_boardgames/parker_eurogame/0/g-1/c-8/75/c-2/15
msgctxt "Parker"
msgid "Sheesh."
msgstr ""

#: parker_boardgames/parker_eurogame/0/g-2/0
msgctxt "Parker"
msgid "Well, I'm gonna go."
msgstr ""

#: parker_boardgames/parker_eurogame/0/g-2/8
msgctxt "Parker"
msgid "Next time, we will roll the dice to find out our relationship."
msgstr ""

#: parker_boardgames/parker_eurogame/0/g-2/16
msgctxt "Parker"
msgid "And honestly? I don't know what to expect."
msgstr ""

#: parker_boardgames/parker_eurogame/0/g-2/24
msgctxt "Parker"
msgid "Maybe we'll roll and it comes up 'Carl'."
msgstr ""

#: parker_boardgames/parker_eurogame/0/g-2/32
msgctxt "Parker"
msgid "Wouldn't that be fun."
msgstr ""

#: parker_boardgames/euro_play/0/0
msgctxt "Parker"
msgid "I'll go first so you can see how a turn usually goes - it consists of five phases."
msgstr ""

#: parker_boardgames/euro_play/0/8
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Parker does a mathematical dance between placing workers, spawning new factories, and gathering new resources to then place again."
msgstr ""

#: parker_boardgames/euro_play/0/16
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Chits and chips fly through his fingers, and it serves to remind you just how well made the pieces really are."
msgstr ""

#: parker_boardgames/euro_play/0/27
msgctxt "Parker"
msgid "That's my turn! I'm prioritizing fermentation technology - the last step in the cream-making process. Now you go."
msgstr ""

#: parker_boardgames/euro_play/0/35/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "<i>Continue placing your pieces into little piles.</i>"
msgstr ""

#: parker_boardgames/euro_play/0/36/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "<i>Prioritize unlocking fancier cream-skimmer machines to skim cream faster.</i>"
msgstr ""

#: parker_boardgames/euro_play/0/37/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "<i>Move your workers towards the cow-fields to generate more bulk milk.</i>"
msgstr ""

#: parker_boardgames/euro_play/0/38/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "<i>Attempt to corner the currency-exchange market.</i>"
msgstr ""

#: parker_boardgames/euro_play/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Parker"
msgid "Hmm... all right. I'll count that as your turn then."
msgstr ""

#: parker_boardgames/euro_play/0/c-0/21
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Parker calculates the correct number of pieces you're supposed to get after your first turn, and you take them gratefully. More to add to your little piles."
msgstr ""

#: parker_boardgames/euro_play/0/c-1/13
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "You plug your resources into the slots to unlock fancier cream-skimmer centrifuges. Soon, you'll be able to make cream faster than Parker."
msgstr ""

#: parker_boardgames/euro_play/0/c-1/21
msgctxt "Parker"
msgid "That's all right - I have more than enough workers for the fermentation process, which you will suffer from!"
msgstr ""

#: parker_boardgames/euro_play/0/c-2/13
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Before long, your factories are awash in more milk than they can handle."
msgstr ""

#: parker_boardgames/euro_play/0/c-3/13
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Your attempts seem feeble compared to Parker's mighty conversion strength."
