#: parker_boardgames/euro_play/0/c-3/32
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "But it seems that his bluster hides the fact that he hasn't taken advantage of his country's own strengths just yet."
msgstr ""

#: parker_boardgames/euro_play/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "The turn goes back to Parker, who spends 10 more minutes going through the five phases."
