msgctxt "Parker"
msgid "Okay - I get the hint! I won't send any burglars your way."
msgstr ""

#: parker_boardgames/euro_play/0/g-0/c-6/7
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Your factories, while resource-poor, can now skim at a greater rate than Parker's."
msgstr ""

#: parker_boardgames/euro_play/0/g-0/c-6/15
msgctxt "Parker"
msgid "What? But I put all my resources into... I...! Hm."
