#: parker_boardgames/euro_win/38
msgctxt "Parker"
msgid "Mmm... Milky..."
msgstr ""

#: parker_boardgames/euro_middle/0/0
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "You and Parker seem to be neck-and-neck in cream production and milk-gathering. You've made it to the Solstice Season, where your respective countries' production will finally be scored."
