#: parker_boardgames/euro_middle/0/16/c-0/34 parker_boardgames/euro_middle/0/g-0/16
msgctxt "Parker"
msgid "You win! I can't out-do the milk-master!"
msgstr ""

#: parker_boardgames/euro_middle/0/16/c-1/7
msgctxt "Parker"
msgid "Nice try, I'm an inanimate object."
