#: parker_boardgames/euro_middle/0/16/c-1/15
msgctxt "Parker"
msgid "I can wait for anything."
msgstr ""

#: parker_boardgames/euro_middle/0/16/c-2/7
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "With great care, you have precisely enough resources to keep your factories humming along."
